        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The swarm is everywhere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into arenas infested with insect hordes. Shape your build into a swarm-slaying machine and carve through the infestation. Venture deeper and face the terrifying Swarm Lords.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultimate Sandbox of Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading abilities unlocks new attack patterns, while your main weapon offers adjustable parameters and multiple bullet types with unique mechanics. Together, these systems create a wide variety of combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/61a4c316e092353d5806c225417b058f.poster.avif?t=1780943936\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/61a4c316e092353d5806c225417b058f.webm?t=1780943936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/61a4c316e092353d5806c225417b058f.mp4?t=1780943936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node Alchemy, Legendary Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast skill tree with over 1,300 nodes. Transmute entire node categories—turn defense into offense or swap one skill for another. Stack node multipliers to empower your abilities and achieve exponential growth. Discover powerful synergies that transform your build into a devastating weapon against the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/58e396da4fdc9e68672e1f464fc9d23e.poster.avif?t=1780943936\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/58e396da4fdc9e68672e1f464fc9d23e.webm?t=1780943936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/58e396da4fdc9e68672e1f464fc9d23e.mp4?t=1780943936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Forge insane builds with a 1,300+ node skill tree</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Transmute entire node categories with Node Alchemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 75 unique weapons and combat abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 100+ enemy types and brutal swarm combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 12 terrifying Swarm Lords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Procedurally generated levels and loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Crafting system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Inventory management and build crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Endless replayability</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The swarm is everywhere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into arenas infested with insect hordes. Shape your build into a swarm-slaying machine and carve through the infestation. Venture deeper and face the terrifying Swarm Lords.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultimate Sandbox of Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading abilities unlocks new attack patterns, while your main weapon offers adjustable parameters and multiple bullet types with unique mechanics. Together, these systems create a wide variety of combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/61a4c316e092353d5806c225417b058f.poster.avif?t=1780943936\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/61a4c316e092353d5806c225417b058f.webm?t=1780943936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/61a4c316e092353d5806c225417b058f.mp4?t=1780943936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node Alchemy, Legendary Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast skill tree with over 1,300 nodes. Transmute entire node categories—turn defense into offense or swap one skill for another. Stack node multipliers to empower your abilities and achieve exponential growth. Discover powerful synergies that transform your build into a devastating weapon against the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/58e396da4fdc9e68672e1f464fc9d23e.poster.avif?t=1780943936\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/58e396da4fdc9e68672e1f464fc9d23e.webm?t=1780943936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/58e396da4fdc9e68672e1f464fc9d23e.mp4?t=1780943936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Forge insane builds with a 1,300+ node skill tree</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Transmute entire node categories with Node Alchemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 75 unique weapons and combat abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 100+ enemy types and brutal swarm combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 12 terrifying Swarm Lords</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Procedurally generated levels and loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Crafting system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Inventory management and build crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Endless replayability</p>",
